Palette notice

The colour palette (the values published in gen-theme-client.mjs and the
tokens it produces) was tuned by RunhuaChen on top of the OpenAI Codex
"absolutely" theme and is released under the MIT licence above. Keep this
attribution when you redistribute or derive from it.

Font notice

